<title>UK: BNG sets $200 million December 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets $200 million December 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    16.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.148   PAY DATE  L-30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.96     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
